1
00:00:00,162 --> 00:00:07,406
Part 14 mein chemist se aaye returns aur expiry claims: invoice se credit note, saleable,

2
00:00:07,406 --> 00:00:13,348
expired aur damaged maal, quarantine, company par claim, acknowledgement,

3
00:00:13,348 --> 00:00:16,766
company ka credit note aur reconciliation.

4
00:00:17,741 --> 00:00:22,827
Return hamesha us invoice se banta hai jisse maal gaya tha.

5
00:00:22,827 --> 00:00:27,138
Isse batch, rate aur GST apne-aap sahi rehte hain.

6
00:00:27,138 --> 00:00:32,569
Invoices mein City Care Chemists ka aaj ka invoice kholte hain.

7
00:00:33,329 --> 00:00:36,042
Neeche credit note ka form hai.

8
00:00:36,042 --> 00:00:42,342
Har line par kitne packs wapas aaye, unki condition, aur credit percent.

9
00:00:42,342 --> 00:00:49,693
Amoxirise CV ke 2 packs saleable hain: yeh wapas usi batch mein stock mein jaayenge.

10
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:55,640
Azivon ke 3 packs toote hue aaye, toh condition Damaged chuniye,

11
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:59,488
aur chemist ke saath tay hua 50 percent credit.

12
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:05,547
Damaged aur expired maal stock mein nahi, balki quarantine mein jaata hai,

13
00:01:05,547 --> 00:01:07,676
company par claim ke liye.

14
00:01:08,356 --> 00:01:12,629
Reason likhiye, jo credit note par chhapta hai.

15
00:01:12,629 --> 00:01:16,357
Button par credit ki rakam dikh rahi hai.

16
00:01:16,357 --> 00:01:19,812
GST bhi usi anupaat mein kam hota hai.

17
00:01:19,812 --> 00:01:22,176
Issue credit note dabaiye.

18
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:27,544
Credit note ban gaya aur chemist ka balance kam ho gaya.

19
00:01:27,544 --> 00:01:34,372
Credit notes screen par saare sales returns ki list hai: number, invoice, chemist,

20
00:01:34,372 --> 00:01:35,788
reason aur rakam.

21
00:01:36,469 --> 00:01:38,257
Ab expiry claims.

22
00:01:38,257 --> 00:01:40,992
Expiry and claims kholiye.

23
00:01:40,992 --> 00:01:47,304
Workbench mein Gastrocalm Gel ka expired batch eligible hai.

24
00:01:47,304 --> 00:01:48,777
Claim dabaiye.

25
00:01:49,451 --> 00:01:53,389
Claim form mein packs, reason expiry, aur note.

26
00:01:53,389 --> 00:02:01,014
Medoro company ke principal agreement se check karta hai ki claim window khuli hai ya nahi,

27
00:02:01,014 --> 00:02:03,611
aur expected credit batata hai.

28
00:02:03,611 --> 00:02:05,287
Raise claim dabaiye.

29
00:02:05,981 --> 00:02:11,608
Claim raise ho gaya aur maal stock se nikal kar claim mein chala gaya.

30
00:02:11,608 --> 00:02:18,761
Claims tab mein har claim ka number, supplier, item, packs, reason, kitne din purana hai,

31
00:02:18,761 --> 00:02:22,057
claim value, credited aur open rakam hai.

32
00:02:22,732 --> 00:02:28,700
Jab company ya C and F claim maan le, Supplier acknowledged dabaiye.

33
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:31,597
Status acknowledged ho jaata hai.

34
00:02:31,597 --> 00:02:36,336
Maal company ko bhejne ka record bhi isi se judta hai.

35
00:02:37,031 --> 00:02:41,635
Company ka credit note aane par Record credit note kholiye,

36
00:02:41,635 --> 00:02:44,679
company ka CN number aur rakam bhariye.

37
00:02:44,679 --> 00:02:47,488
Hum yahan sirf form dikha rahe hain.

38
00:02:47,488 --> 00:02:53,419
Asli settlement tabhi darj kariye jab company ka credit note sach mein mile.

39
00:02:54,184 --> 00:03:01,027
Reconciliation tab har supplier ka hisaab dikhata hai: kitne claims, kitna claim kiya,

40
00:03:01,027 --> 00:03:05,880
kitna credit mila, kitna write-off hua, kitna abhi khula hai,

41
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:09,540
aur sabse purana khula claim kitne din ka hai.

42
00:03:10,374 --> 00:03:14,164
Har company ki claim window alag hoti hai,

43
00:03:14,164 --> 00:03:20,209
jaise expiry se 60 ya 90 din pehle se lekar 90 ya 180 din baad tak.

44
00:03:20,209 --> 00:03:26,796
Window band hone ke baad claim nahi hota, aur maal ka poora nuksan aapka.

45
00:03:26,796 --> 00:03:29,954
Isliye workbench har hafte dekhiye.

46
00:03:31,690 --> 00:03:37,941
Part 22 mein MIS reports aur business intelligence: chaudah MIS reports,

47
00:03:37,941 --> 00:03:44,626
date range aur CSV export, phir reorder suggestions, expiry risk, dead stock,

48
00:03:44,626 --> 00:03:51,918
profitability, scheme results, credit risk, sales forecast aur management assistant.

49
00:03:52,888 --> 00:03:55,890
Finance mein MIS reports kholiye.

50
00:03:55,890 --> 00:04:02,896
Website par chaudah MIS reports likhe hain, aur yahan sach mein chaudah hain.

51
00:04:02,896 --> 00:04:08,719
Har aankda posted invoices, GRN, vouchers aur stock se aata hai,

52
00:04:08,719 --> 00:04:12,540
aur har report CSV mein download hoti hai.

53
00:04:13,249 --> 00:04:20,569
Ek-ek karke dekhte hain: sales register, product-wise, company-wise aur chemist-wise sales,

54
00:04:20,569 --> 00:04:25,557
salesman performance, territory-wise sales, purchase register.

55
00:04:28,985 --> 00:04:36,357
Phir batch-wise stock statement, outstanding aur ageing, collections, scheme report,

56
00:04:36,357 --> 00:04:41,272
delivery performance, supplier claims, aur credit notes.

57
00:04:41,272 --> 00:04:42,325
Kul chaudah.

58
00:04:43,272 --> 00:04:45,437
Sales by product kholiye.

59
00:04:45,437 --> 00:04:53,405
Har product ke bike packs, free packs, taxable sales, cost, gross margin aur margin percent.

60
00:04:53,405 --> 00:05:01,460
Isse pata chalta hai ki kaunsa product sach mein kamaata hai aur kaunsa sirf volume deta hai.

61
00:05:02,125 --> 00:05:06,583
Date range badal kar Apply kariye, jaise pichhle mahine ka.

62
00:05:06,583 --> 00:05:11,418
CSV dabaate hi file Excel mein khulne ke liye download hoti hai,

63
00:05:11,418 --> 00:05:14,289
jise CA ya company ko bhej sakte hain.

64
00:05:14,978 --> 00:05:23,232
Outstanding and ageing report har chemist ka limit, balance, overdue aur 0 se 30, 31 se 60,

65
00:05:23,232 --> 00:05:26,044
aur purane buckets dikhata hai.

66
00:05:26,044 --> 00:05:29,854
Vasooli ki meeting isi report se chalaiye.

67
00:05:30,562 --> 00:05:32,747
Ab Business intelligence.

68
00:05:32,747 --> 00:05:39,127
Yeh koi jaadu wala AI nahi, balki aapke apne data ka saaf statistics hai.

69
00:05:39,127 --> 00:05:45,770
Kuch bhi apne-aap post nahi hota: kharid ke sujhav sirf draft PO bante hain,

70
00:05:45,770 --> 00:05:48,654
jinhe aap jaanch kar bhejte hain.

71
00:05:49,348 --> 00:05:56,693
Automatic reorder suggestions: pichhle 120 din ki demand, lead time, cover aur safety days,

72
00:05:56,693 --> 00:06:03,714
aur haath ka stock, order mein aaya maal aur reservation ghata kar, kitna mangwana hai.

73
00:06:03,714 --> 00:06:07,992
Create draft POs dabaane par draft PO ban jaate hain.

74
00:06:08,706 --> 00:06:14,515
Expiry loss tab batata hai kis batch par kitna nuksan ho sakta hai.

75
00:06:14,515 --> 00:06:17,983
Dead stock: jo maal 90 din se nahi bika.

76
00:06:17,983 --> 00:06:25,353
Product profitability aur scheme profitability: scheme se pehle aur scheme ke dauraan

77
00:06:25,353 --> 00:06:26,654
margin ka fark.

78
00:06:27,361 --> 00:06:32,129
Credit risk har chemist ka risk score aur uske kaaran dikhata hai,

79
00:06:32,129 --> 00:06:35,741
aur Sales forecast agle 30 din ki sambhavit bikri.

80
00:06:35,741 --> 00:06:40,581
Yeh sab Professional plan ke business intelligence mein shamil hai.

81
00:06:41,252 --> 00:06:44,805
Upar management reporting assistant hai.

82
00:06:44,805 --> 00:06:47,114
Who owes us money dabaiye.

83
00:06:47,114 --> 00:06:55,552
Jawab fixed queries se aata hai, kisi bahari AI model se nahi: kis chemist par kitna baaki hai.

84
00:06:56,222 --> 00:07:00,634
What should I reorder dabaane par reorder ki list aati hai.

85
00:07:00,634 --> 00:07:05,944
In reports aur insights ka niyamit upyog karke distributor apna margin,

86
00:07:05,944 --> 00:07:09,010
stock aur udhaar teeno sambhal sakta hai.
